ndwritten notes by unknown.\nPublished on the occasion of the retrospective exhibition of Georgia O'Keeffe's works organized by the Whitney Museum of American Art in 1970 and shown subsequently at the Art Institute of Chicago and the San Francisco Museum of Art.\nSColl abq : per inventory : Sitting Room.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}